11
00:00:33,208 --> 00:00:34,228
"And this is Amy."

12
00:00:34,443 --> 00:00:35,913
"We're not home right now."

13
00:00:36,111 --> 00:00:38,741
"'Cause we out dropping science, son."

14
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:46,883
- "Leave a message."
- "Leave a message."

15
00:00:48,957 --> 00:00:50,787
Beep. Heh.

16
